    "description": {
      "value": "This clockwork traveler's chair has spinnerets and spider legs that allow it to roll up walls, fire web lines to pull you to a location, and obstruct foes with webs. While using the chair, you gain a climb Speed equal to your Speed.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n\nThe chair shoots a web line at a solid wall, floor, or ceiling up to 60 feet away and then pulls itself and you to that location.\n\n- **Activate:** 3 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per hour\n\nYou cause the chair to launch an enormous web to hinder your foes, with the effects of a 4th-level web spell."
